                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJGeg9A5qrQjQRsB8FR8ibd-Y/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNfOE16OW9RRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Walked past this place multiple times and finally decided to try it out! The interior is super clean and chic. They give everyone a paper bib to prevent spills. All the cutlery and plates are super cute. Usually good aesthetics may mean not so good food but that’s not the case here! The meat and side dishes are amazing, well seasoned and not too oily. Highly recommend the jumeokbap and seafood pancake!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
